{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789390/extras/4cc6e056fb2896a47b137dcfff5a8124.poster.avif?t=1763983584\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789390/extras/4cc6e056fb2896a47b137dcfff5a8124.webm?t=1763983584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789390/extras/4cc6e056fb2896a47b137dcfff5a8124.mp4?t=1763983584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your spaceship crash-landed in an alien jungle, and you barely escaped using your escape pod. Now, you'll have to cross the jungle to find a city where you can hopefully launch yourself back into space and find your way home again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guided by your trusty escape pod, you'll traverse 33 unique levels and face 3 epic bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a brick-breaker, like a cross between Pong and Arkanoid, you can play alone or coop with a friend.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SCREEN TILT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Paddlenoid you'll have more control over your ball (your trusty escape pod) then it may at first seem. You can make a shot that seemed impossible, or ruin one that seemed in the bag, by tilting the screen and changing the trajectory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789390/extras/9bf811aa6172f723d970517182bbb0cb.poster.avif?t=1763983584\" width=444 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789390/extras/9bf811aa6172f723d970517182bbb0cb.webm?t=1763983584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789390/extras/9bf811aa6172f723d970517182bbb0cb.mp4?t=1763983584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player or two-player local (couch) coop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tilt your screen to control the escape pod when it's in flight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with 3, 5 or 7 pods in reserve.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 different episode with a total of 33 levels and 3 boss fights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An engaging story that has absolutely nothing more to it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're definitely not helping the alien fleet take control of our galaxy.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OTHER FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At any time during gameplay, press F1 to get help.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press F8 to send feedback about anything your encounter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can control the paddles with the mouse, keyboard or controller depending on your preference.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Fullscreen or in Windowed mode.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2789390?t=1763983584","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789390/1e260b2ff108745b69558d07d3d6a83a99cae60c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763983584","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789390/629f016100eafc2a1e0b2e35e8ea0b4ec92db920/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763983584","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789390/629f016100eafc2a1e0b2e35e8ea0b4ec92db920/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763983584","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789390/extras/4cc6e056fb2896a47b137dcfff5a8124.poster.avif?t=1763983584\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789390/extras/4cc6e056fb2896a47b137dcfff5a8124.webm?t=1763983584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789390/extras/4cc6e056fb2896a47b137dcfff5a8124.mp4?t=1763983584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your spaceship crash-landed in an alien jungle, and you barely escaped using your escape pod. Now, you'll have to cross the jungle to find a city where you can hopefully launch yourself back into space and find your way home again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guided by your trusty escape pod, you'll traverse 33 unique levels and face 3 epic bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a brick-breaker, like a cross between Pong and Arkanoid, you can play alone or coop with a friend.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SCREEN TILT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Paddlenoid you'll have more control over your ball (your trusty escape pod) then it may at first seem. You can make a shot that seemed impossible, or ruin one that seemed in the bag, by tilting the screen and changing the trajectory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789390/extras/9bf811aa6172f723d970517182bbb0cb.poster.avif?t=1763983584\" width=444 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789390/extras/9bf811aa6172f723d970517182bbb0cb.webm?t=1763983584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789390/extras/9bf811aa6172f723d970517182bbb0cb.mp4?t=1763983584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player or two-player local (couch) coop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tilt your screen to control the escape pod when it's in flight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with 3, 5 or 7 pods in reserve.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 different episode with a total of 33 levels and 3 boss fights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An engaging story that has absolutely nothing more to it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're definitely not helping the alien fleet take control of our galaxy.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OTHER FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At any time during gameplay, press F1 to get help.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press F8 to send feedback about anything your encounter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can control the paddles with the mouse, keyboard or controller depending on your preference.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Fullscreen or in Windowed mode.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Deadbug Projects"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789390/df536ea4829e75fb239e372cfc154fab8da03aaa/header.jpg?t=1763983584","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies